# Vercel deploy allowlist. The prototype ships static UI + api shims only.
# Everything else is either air-gap payload (models), server source, or
# secrets-adjacent. Without this file `vercel` uploads them all, including
# the 58MB ONNX model and ui/server.go source. True 403 status on Vercel
# static is not possible via rewrites (serves 200); real 403 enforcement
# lives in ui/server.go. See docs/403-honeypot.md.
models/
output/
vector_data/
ingestion/
parsing/
storage/
tests/
.env.example
Dockerfile.lumber
docker-compose.yml
init.sql
Makefile
ui/*.go
ui/go.mod
ui/go.sum
*.md
.DS_Store
